      "text": "Inquiry details * Name * Name of your company Department name/title URL of your company's webpage Phone number * (without hyphens) E-mail * E-mail (confirmation) * Please read our Privacy Policy related to inquiries. Please check the \"I agree to the handling of personal information\" checkbox if you agree. Privacy Policy related to inquiries 1. Personal Information Manager Personal Information Manager, Compliance Office, PIALA INC. Contact: +81 3 6362 6831 2. Purpose of using personal information (1) To provide answer to your inquiry (2) To provide information on our products and services 3. Provision of personal information to third parties We do not provide customers' personal information to third parties. 4. Outsourcing of administration of personal information PIALA may outsource the administration of personal information for our business operations. In such cases, we shall select an outsourcing contractor with high standards of personal information protection, enter into an agreement for the proper management and confidentiality of personal information, and supervise the implementation of appropriate management. 5. Request for disclosure, etc. of personal information Customers may request PIALA to disclose their personal information (including notification and disclosure of purpose of use, correction, addition, deletion, suspension of use, or elimination of contents, suspension of provision to third parties) by contacting our inquiry desk. In such cases, we shall address the matter within a reasonable time period after confirming your identity. 6. Optionality of providing personal information Filling out the form below is at your discretion. Please understand that we will not be able to respond to your inquiry if you do not fill in the required fields. Contact Information Please use the following contact information for inquiries, complaints, or requests for disclosure, etc. regarding our privacy policy. 13th Floor Yebisu Garden Place Tower, 4-20-3 Ebisu, Shibuya-ku, Tokyo, 150-6013 Japan TEL: +81 3 6362 6831 (Switchboard) FAX: +81 3 5793 8888 Email: info@piala.co.jp I agree to the handling of personal information"
